{"id":"c5aef541ec919a87","group":"62","path":"62/62-df-Sigma01-separation.md","title":"Sigma-Zero-One Separation Schema","display":"df-Sigma01-separation — Sigma-Zero-One Separation Schema","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-df-Sigma01-separation","aliases":["62-df-Sigma01-separation"],"display":"df-Sigma01-separation — Sigma-Zero-One Separation Schema","depends_on":["[[62-df-ArithmeticHierarchy]]","[[62-df-L2]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Lemma IV.4.4","source_pages":[142,143],"source_pdf_pages":[160,161]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-df-Sigma01-separation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-df-Sigma01-separation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-Sigma01-separation — Sigma-Zero-One Separation Schema"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"eaea482f0ad24c81\" href=\"?note=eaea482f0ad24c81\" title=\"62-df-ArithmeticHierarchy\">62-df-ArithmeticHierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Lemma IV.4.4"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>142</span><span>143</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>160</span><span>161</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>公式类见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"eaea482f0ad24c81\" href=\"?note=eaea482f0ad24c81\" title=\"62-df-ArithmeticHierarchy\">62-df-ArithmeticHierarchy</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UC}\">\\(\\operatorname{UC}\\)</span> 与自由变量见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_0(n),\\varphi_1(n)\">\\(\\varphi_0(n),\\varphi_1(n)\\)</span> 属于下式所列公式类，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\varphi_0)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\varphi_1)\">\\(X\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\varphi_0)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\varphi_1)\\)</span>。数、集合参数均由 UC 关闭。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in V_N\">\\(n\\in V_N\\)</span> 是模式的固定指定数变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in V_S\">\\(X\\in V_S\\)</span> 随实例选择，选择域及自由变量排除条件在集合构造中显式给出。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}Sigma01\\text{-}separation}\\vdash\\;\\Sigma^0_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Sep}(S_2)\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{UC}(\\neg\\exists n(\\varphi_0\\land\\varphi_1)\\to\\exists X\\forall n[(\\varphi_0\\to n\\in X)\\land(\\varphi_1\\to n\\notin X)]):\\varphi_0,\\varphi_1\\in\\Sigma^0_1(S_2),\\ X\\in V_S\\setminus(\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\varphi_0)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\varphi_1))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}Sigma01\\text{-}separation}\\vdash\\;\\Sigma^0_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Sep}(S_2)\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{UC}(\\neg\\exists n(\\varphi_0\\land\\varphi_1)\\to\\exists X\\forall n[(\\varphi_0\\to n\\in X)\\land(\\varphi_1\\to n\\notin X)]):\\varphi_0,\\varphi_1\\in\\Sigma^0_1(S_2),\\ X\\in V_S\\setminus(\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\varphi_0)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\varphi_1))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>分离只决定两类上的成员条件，允许 X 在两类之外自由取值；它不要求存在任一类本身的理解集。Σ⁰₁ 与 Π⁰₁ 在这个原则中的强度不同，不能通过将“前缀类取补”误认为两者自动等价。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Lemma IV.4.4；纸面页 142, 143；PDF 页 160, 161。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-ArithmeticHierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"eaea482f0ad24c81","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-ArithmeticHierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-L2","status":"resolved","id":"4c6d2d9f1999915f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-L2]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-ArithmeticHierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"eaea482f0ad24c81","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"公式类见 [[62-df-ArithmeticHierarchy]]，$\\operatorname{UC}$ 与自由变量见 [[62-df-L2]]。$\\varphi_0(n),\\varphi_1(n)$ 属于下式所列公式类，$X\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\varphi_0)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\varphi_1)$。数、集合参数均由 UC 关闭。","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-L2","status":"resolved","id":"4c6d2d9f1999915f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"公式类见 [[62-df-ArithmeticHierarchy]]，$\\operatorname{UC}$ 与自由变量见 [[62-df-L2]]。$\\varphi_0(n),\\varphi_1(n)$ 属于下式所列公式类，$X\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\varphi_0)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\varphi_1)$。数、集合参数均由 UC 关闭。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{UC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_0(n),\\varphi_1(n)","display":false},{"tex":"X\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\varphi_0)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\varphi_1)","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in V_N","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in V_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}Sigma01\\text{-}separation}\\vdash\\;\\Sigma^0_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Sep}(S_2)\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{UC}(\\neg\\exists n(\\varphi_0\\land\\varphi_1)\\to\\exists X\\forall n[(\\varphi_0\\to n\\in X)\\land(\\varphi_1\\to n\\notin X)]):\\varphi_0,\\varphi_1\\in\\Sigma^0_1(S_2),\\ X\\in V_S\\setminus(\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\varphi_0)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\varphi_1))\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1618,"backlinks":[{"id":"c68a6ecbed6addff","anchor":"ref-99","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[62-df-Sigma01-separation|Sigma-Zero-One Separation Schema]]"},{"id":"a2ad5b59a046bcd5","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RCA}_0,\\mathrm{WKL}_0$ 见 [[62-df-RCA0]]、[[62-df-WKL0]]，$\\Sigma^0_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Sep}(S_2)$ 见 [[62-df-Sigma01-separation]]，$\\mathrm{DRS}$ 见 [[62-df-disjoint-range-separation]]；有限或单射枚举引理见 [[62-lem-RCA0-Sigma1-enumeration]]，EquivOver 见 [[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]。"},{"id":"2f82a3f70705c4ee","anchor":"ref-41","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[62-df-Sigma01-separation]]"},{"id":"271bc9074a256041","anchor":"ref-216","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[62-df-Sigma01-separation]]"}],"outgoing":["eaea482f0ad24c81","4c6d2d9f1999915f"]}